test "rank294: Cabot renders status check error inside Django autoescape off"
lang config
file statuscheck_detail.html
expect VYQL-INJ-028
code
```
<table>
  <tbody>
  {% for result in checkresults %}
    <tr>
      <td>{{ result.time_complete }}</td>
      <td>{% autoescape off %}{{ result.error|default:"" }}{% endautoescape %}</td>
    </tr>
  {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
```

test "rank294: Cabot status check error uses normal Django escaping"
